{"id":"cautiva-tmdb-333631","type":"SERIES","category":"STREAMING","title":"Cautiva","overview":"La serie narra la historia de Clara, una joven que en pleno siglo XXI, y abrazando su vocación religiosa, entra a un convento de clausura, sin imaginar que ahí dentro, Cecilia, la madre superiora, descargará su locura sobre las monjas, convirtiendo sus vidas en un infierno medieval. ​Quince años después, con un estado físico y psicológico que bordea lo inhumano, logra escapar de allí. Ayudada por su familia, comienza un proceso de reconstrucción de sí misma e inicia una infatigable lucha en búsqueda de justicia.","releaseDate":"2026-09-18","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWCL01IPrfDTjO2VTzMwZvVPzXv.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/eH8dA6pqku0uWlaqAvbCB79i86f.jpg","genres":["Drama","Crimen"],"originalLanguage":"es","spokenLanguages":["Spanish"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/405geyMTK8QPfSJnV98IobyLqUH.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/rW87YKX9VdewwqNwRztcUW2M56z.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3wyqNp1FJOf78i1KRfIzlDnrmUj.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/eH8dA6pqku0uWlaqAvbCB79i86f.jpg","label":"Escena 04"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/vbo6Z5OQvCVy4sQXPw14gNlplmJ.jpg","label":"Escena 05"}],"ratings":{"tmdb":7},"availability":{"platforms":["HBO Max","HBO Max Amazon Channel"],"networks":["TNT Latin America"]},"saga":{"name":"Cautiva","items":[{"title":"Temporada 1","year":"2026","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWCL01IPrfDTjO2VTzMwZvVPzXv.jpg","rating":8,"extra":"6 episodios"}]},"cast":[{"name":"Carolina Kopelioff","role":"Clara","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knCUrmSIwY7dYPjqQltKjC1mNYL.jpg","personTmdbId":1731984,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":6},{"name":"Lorena Vega","role":"Priora Cecilia","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOGnE0zRmekWkPJpt3RRtD7SOnN.jpg","personTmd